# Layer A density v4 fixture: 21-fixpoint-factorial with deeper inference.
#
# v4 vs v2/v3:
#   - The `factT FNT [intT] intT` declaration is elided. The elaborator
#     synthesizes it from the FIX's recursionType reference + the body
#     LAM's signature (parameters and return type).
#   - The recursion-slot param `recurse` no longer needs `:factT`. The
#     elaborator fills in paramType from FIX.recursionType.
#   - The `n:intT` annotation is also elided. The elaborator infers `n`'s
#     paramType from its use as the first arg of `APP eqInt [n 0]` (the
#     reserved `eqInt` builtin's FunctionType is `(intT, intT) -> boolT`).
#
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 21-fixpoint-factorial.json's.
@v=1 root=app
nIsZero APP eqInt [n 0]
_ APP sub [n 1]
recCall APP recurse [@last]
mulBody APP mul [n recCall]
matchBody IF nIsZero 1 mulBody
bodyLam LAM [recurse n] matchBody
fact FIX factT bodyLam
app APP fact [5]
